# Allow-list: the build context is only what the wheel needs.
# Everything else (.git, tests, docs + screenshots, tools, examples, local data,
# .env files, caches, virtualenvs) never reaches the Docker daemon.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!ana/

# ...and nothing generated inside the package tree.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.jsonl
**/.env
**/.env.*
